×ÌÌÌôôôÙ8ïììÌDÄVVVw|ãÆ^æPf–'''ÿ?¹\ÎDÄ•ÿú×¿>ËÈÈm,3»º¦§§w˜<yòjµº¼±,O>ùäê¦Ì1GÂ␀␀␀ÄÌ.C‡M÷ööæÆ$ËÖÖ–=<<t‘‘‘š~ýúiúöí«			Ñ¸¸¸pcâ"•J¹K—.å‹-J3õmóûMx‰ˆV¯^ÄDÄ®®®üì³ÏÎ1—˜,Y²$:>>þš‹¢ÈöööÜ®];MÏž=5			šèèhZ­®mœžÑXŽI“&ýÀÌžfÖÆ&L˜¯T*o%åîîîµÝ»w×4H3pà@Mtt´ÆÅÅ¥ºñŽƒµµ5GDD¬;tèÒÄûŽ„␀␀ %Þ}÷ÝÞ={öÜîîî~+©ý«ÍÚÚš;tèP=|øðO>dNåhHx5	¯ž™ÝîÈS¦L™Û8ÙÃÃƒßyçÉÌ,šCY®_¿0{öì¥;w¾¡R©þ6¢(²‹‹80ïÅ_L”ËÍsFÓ&--me```ÝÚ—B¡`ŸãÆ{ÏTªý¡8Œ5ªª!á­™0a‚Ž␀p?ðâ	␀3ÁÌôüóÏï’Ëå»–,YÒw×®]½®]»[WW×¦¤¤„”J%yxxP]]Ý‘Ç{ì\\\Ü—½{÷>µnÝ:³*Giii o‘J„Z"ª¾C’ÏÌ¼(//OÌÌÌ”
§Nò$";"*7uYÜÜÜ.Ñ´³gÏ.Û¼yó¨;w¶³²²ŠÍÏÏ'½^OvvväëëKr¹ü›Î;gÎš5ëˆ ÅæÚÆ/1ó„/¿üráºuëRjjjj4Ï’’bfruu%WW×b•Jµ¥ÿþkÆ—½zõjsØu-- "["ªV©Tµ8b␀␀␀´œ$Xdf›;vØÙ0³B¡@Å˜ˆ\.'f¶ùõ×_mvìØaÃÌ6Ìls?+k˜Yû’1³MFF†MFFFcy°Æ-␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀´4ÿÐ@üAw'„␀␀␀␀IEND®B`‚Oúòbplist00Ô
X$versionY$archiverT$topX$objects␀† _NSKeyedArchiverÑ	_WebResourceResponse€«#)*01234U$nullÛ !"V$class___nsurlrequest_proto_prop_obj_6R$1___nsurlrequest_proto_prop_obj_4___nsurlrequest_proto_prop_obj_3___nsurlrequest_proto_prop_obj_2___nsurlrequest_proto_prop_obj_1R$2___nsurlrequest_proto_prop_obj_0___nsurlrequest_proto_prop_obj_5R$0€
€	␀€␀€€€€€Ó$%'(WNS.base[NS.relative€␀€€_ø.data:image/png;base64,Ò+,-.Z$classnameX$classesUNSURL¢-/XNSObject#AÈõ~•¼EYimage/pngº#ïÿÿÿÿÿÿÒ+,56]NSURLResponse¢7/]NSURLResponse␀␀␀␀$␀)␀2␀7␀I␀L␀b␀d␀p␀v␀␀”␀¶␀¹␀Û␀ýADfˆ‹‘“•—™›Ÿ¡¨°¼¾ÀÂùôùùúúúúúú(ú2ú5ú>úCúQúT␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀8␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀úb_ø.data:image/png;base64,Õ;	<=>?@_WebResourceFrameNameUUTF-8O␀±<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Get Your Ducks In A Row â€” Local Real Estate, Done Right</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,300;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,500&amp;family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#122036;
    --ink-soft:#2b3a54;
    --paper:#FBF7EE;
    --paper-dim:#F1ECDF;
    --duck:#FFC93C;
    --duck-deep:#E9AC1E;
    --pond:#2A6F77;
    --pond-deep:#1E4F55;
    --coral:#E4572E;
    --line: rgba(18,32,54,0.14);
    --line-light: rgba(251,247,238,0.18);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;
    margin:0;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:0.14em;
    font-size:0.72rem;
    font-weight:700;
  }
  a{color:inherit;}
  .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;}
  section{position:relative;}

  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
  nav{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;
    background:rgba(251,247,238,0.86);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  nav .wrap{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    padding-top:16px;padding-bottom:16px;
  }
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
  .brand-mark{width:30px;height:30px;flex-shrink:0;}
  .brand-name{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:600;font-size:1.05rem;}
  .nav-links{display:flex;gap:28px;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:500;}
  .nav-links a{text-decoration:none;opacity:0.75;transition:opacity .2s;}
  .nav-links a:hover{opacity:1;}
  .nav-cta{
    background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);
    padding:9px 18px;border-radius:100px;
    font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .nav-links{display:none;} }

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    padding:76px 0 40px;
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 0.95fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;
  }
  @media (max-width:900px){ .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:48px;} }

  .hero-eyebrow{color:var(--pond-deep);margin-bottom:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:1.05rem;letter-spacing:0.12em;}
  .hero-eyebrow .dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--coral);display:inline-block;}
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(2.6rem, 5.4vw, 4.4rem);
    line-height:0.98;
  }
  .hero h1 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--pond-deep);}
  .hero p.lede{
    font-size:1.14rem;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink-soft);
    max-width:46ch;margin:22px 0 30px;
  }
  .hero-actions{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;}
  .btn-primary{
    background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);
    padding:15px 26px;border-radius:100px;
    font-weight:600;font-size:0.95rem;text-decoration:none;
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
    transition:transform .18s ease, background .18s ease;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);background:var(--pond-deep);}
  .btn-ghost{
    padding:15px 22px;border-radius:100px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);
    font-weight:600;font-size:0.95rem;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);
    transition:border-color .18s ease, background .18s ease;
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper-dim);}

  .found-note{
    margin-top:26px;font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:0.76rem;
    color:var(--ink-soft);opacity:0.75;max-width:40ch;line-height:1.6;
  }

  /* ---------- HERO DUCK VISUAL ---------- */
  .duck-stage{
    position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    min-height:420px;
  }
  .ripple-ring{
    position:absolute;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid var(--pond);
    opacity:0.22;
  }
  .ripple-1{width:300px;height:300px;}
  .ripple-2{width:390px;height:390px;opacity:0.14;}
  .ripple-3{width:480px;height:480px;opacity:0.08;}
  .duck-svg-wrap{
    position:relative;z-index:2;
    animation:bob 5.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    filter:drop-shadow(0 18px 24px rgba(18,32,54,0.16));
  }
  @keyframes bob{
    0%,100%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(-2deg);}
    50%{transform:translateY(-10px) rotate(1deg);}
  }
  .qr-patch{
    position:absolute; bottom:6%; right:2%;
    width:74px;height:74px;
    background:var(--paper);
    border:2.5px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius:8px;
    transform:rotate(9deg);
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);grid-template-rows:repeat(5,1fr);
    padding:6px;gap:2px;
    box-shadow:0 6px 14px rgba(18,32,54,0.25);
    z-index:3;
  }
  .qr-patch i{background:var(--ink);border-radius:1px;}
  .qr-patch i.off{background:transparent;}
  .qr-tag{
    position:absolute;bottom:26%;right:0%;
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:0.68rem;font-weight:700;
    background:var(--coral);color:var(--paper);
    padding:5px 9px;border-radius:6px;transform:rotate(6deg);
    box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(228,87,46,0.35);
    z-index:4;
  }
  @media (max-width:900px){ .duck-stage{min-height:320px;} .qr-patch{width:58px;height:58px;bottom:2%;right:4%;} }

  /* ---------- MEET THE AGENT ---------- */
  .agent-section{padding:8px 0 76px;}
  .agent-card{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:34px;align-items:center;
    background:var(--paper-dim); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:22px;
    padding:36px 38px;
  }
  @media (max-width:700px){ .agent-card{grid-template-columns:1fr;text-align:center;} }
  .agent-photo-wrap{position:relative;width:150px;height:150px;flex-shrink:0;margin:0 auto;}
  .agent-photo{
    width:150px;height:150px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;
    border:4px solid var(--paper); box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(18,32,54,0.18);
    display:block;
  }
  .agent-photo-ring{
    position:absolute;inset:-8px;border-radius:50%;
    border:1.5px dashed var(--pond); opacity:0.4;
  }
  .agent-badge{
    position:absolute;bottom:-6px;right:-6px;
    background:var(--duck);color:var(--ink);
    width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    border:3px solid var(--paper-dim); box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
  }
  .agent-badge svg{width:18px;height:18px;}
  .agent-copy .eyebrow{color:var(--pond-deep);}
  .agent-copy h3{font-size:1.7rem;margin-top:10px;}
  .agent-copy .agent-title{
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--ink-soft);
    margin-top:4px;letter-spacing:0.04em;
  }
  .agent-copy p.agent-bio{
    margin-top:14px;font-size:0.98rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:56ch;
  }
  @media (max-width:700px){ .agent-copy p.agent-bio{margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;} }

  /* ---------- WAVE DIVIDER ---------- */
  .wave-divider{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;margin-top:-1px;}

  /* ---------- STATS / WHY LOCAL ---------- */
  .local-section{
    background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);
    padding:96px 0 100px;
  }
  .local-head{max-width:640px;margin-bottom:56px;}
  .local-head .eyebrow{color:var(--duck);}
  .local-head h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.4vw,2.7rem);margin-top:14px;line-height:1.12;}
  .local-head p{color:rgba(251,247,238,0.7);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.6;margin-top:16px;max-width:56ch;}

  .local-grid{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;
    background:var(--line-light);
    border:1px solid var(--line-light);
    border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;
  }
  @media (max-width:820px){ .local-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .local-card{background:var(--ink);padding:34px 30px;}
  .local-card .num{
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;color:var(--duck);font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:700;
  }
  .local-card h3{font-size:1.28rem;margin:16px 0 10px;color:var(--paper);}
  .local-card p{margin:0;color:rgba(251,247,238,0.68);font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.6;}

  /* ---------- DUCKS IN A ROW (PROCESS) ---------- */
  .process-section{padding:110px 0 90px;}
  .process-head{max-width:620px;margin:0 auto 20px;text-align:center;}
  .process-head .eyebrow{color:var(--coral);justify-content:center;}
  .process-head h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,3.6vw,2.9rem);margin-top:14px;}
  .process-head p{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:16px;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.6;}

  .pond-track{
    position:relative;margin-top:80px;padding-bottom:20px;
  }
  .pond-path-svg{width:100%;display:block;}
  .duck-row{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:14px;
    margin-top:-190px;
    position:relative;z-index:2;
  }
  @media (max-width:980px){
    .duck-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:36px;margin-top:24px;}
    .pond-path-svg{display:none;}
  }
  .duck-step{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:0 8px;}
  .duck-step svg{width:64px;height:64px;}
  .duck-step-icon{width:60px;height:auto;display:block;}
  .duck-step .step-tag{
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--pond-deep);
    margin-top:14px;
  }
  .duck-step h3{font-size:1.05rem;margin-top:6px;}
  .duck-step p{font-size:0.87rem;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.55;margin-top:8px;max-width:22ch;}

  /* ---------- DETAILS MATTER ---------- */
  .details-section{
    background:var(--paper-dim);
    padding:100px 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .details-grid{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.1fr;gap:60px;align-items:center;
  }
  @media (max-width:900px){ .details-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .details-copy .eyebrow{color:var(--coral);}
  .details-copy h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,2.5rem);margin-top:14px;line-height:1.15;}
  .details-copy p{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:18px;font-size:1.03rem;line-height:1.65;max-width:48ch;}

  .checklist{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;}
  .checklist li{
    display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;
    padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .checklist li:first-child{padding-top:0;}
  .checklist svg{flex-shrink:0;width:22px;height:22px;margin-top:2px;}
  .checklist .label{font-weight:600;font-size:1rem;}
  .checklist .desc{font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:3px;line-height:1.5;}

  /* ---------- CONCIERGE ---------- */
  .concierge-section{padding:110px 0;}
  .concierge-head{max-width:680px;margin-bottom:56px;}
  .concierge-head .eyebrow{color:var(--pond-deep);}
  .concierge-head h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,3.6vw,2.8rem);margin-top:14px;}
  .concierge-head p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.6;margin-top:16px;max-width:56ch;}

  .concierge-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px;}
  @media (max-width:900px){ .concierge-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);} }
  @media (max-width:560px){ .concierge-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .concierge-card{
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:28px 24px;
    background:var(--paper);transition:border-color .2s ease, transform .2s ease;
  }
  .concierge-card:hover{border-color:var(--pond); transform:translateY(-3px);}
  .concierge-card svg{width:30px;height:30px;color:var(--pond-deep);}
  .concierge-card h3{font-size:1.02rem;margin-top:16px;}
  .concierge-card p{font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:8px;line-height:1.55;}

  /* ---------- FINAL CTA ---------- */
  .final-cta{
    background:var(--pond-deep);color:var(--paper);
    padding:100px 0 90px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .final-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 0.8fr;gap:50px;align-items:center;}
  @media (max-width:880px){ .final-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;text-align:center;} .final-grid .qr-block{justify-self:center;} }
  .final-cta .eyebrow{color:var(--duck);}
  .final-cta h2{font-size:clamp(2.1rem,4vw,3.1rem);margin-top:16px;line-height:1.1;}
  .final-cta p{color:rgba(251,247,238,0.78);margin-top:18px;font-size:1.05rem;max-width:44ch;line-height:1.6;}
  .final-actions{margin-top:30px;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .btn-duck{
    background:var(--duck);color:var(--ink);
    padding:16px 28px;border-radius:100px;font-weight:700;font-size:0.97rem;
    text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
    transition:transform .18s ease;
  }
  .btn-duck:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .btn-outline-light{
    padding:16px 24px;border-radius:100px;border:1.5px solid rgba(251,247,238,0.4);
    color:var(--paper);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:0.97rem;
  }
  .qr-block{
    background:var(--paper);border-radius:22px;padding:26px;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:14px;
    box-shadow:0 24px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.28);
    max-width:260px;
  }
  .qr-block .qr-big{
    width:180px;height:180px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(9,1fr);
    grid-template-rows:repeat(9,1fr);gap:2px;
  }
  .qr-block .qr-big i{background:var(--ink);border-radius:1px;}
  .qr-block .qr-big i.off{background:transparent;}
  .qr-block .qr-cap{
    font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--ink-soft);text-align:center;
  }

  /* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */
  footer{padding:30px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);}
  footer .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;}
  footer .foot-brand{display:flex;align-items:center;}
  footer .foot-logo{height:34px;width:auto;display:block;opacity:0.88;}
  footer .foot-note{font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  footer .foot-note em{font-style:normal;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);}

  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{animation:none !important;transition:none !important;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brand">
      <svg class="brand-mark" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none">
        <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="15" fill="#FFC93C" stroke="#122036" stroke-width="1.5"></circle>
        <circle cx="21" cy="12" r="1.6" fill="#122036"></circle>
        <path d="M8 20c2-6 8-10 15-8" stroke="#122036" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"></path>
      </svg>
      <span class="brand-name">Stacy Barnes Â· Advantage Realty Group</span>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#why-local">Why Local</a>
      <a href="#process">The Process</a>
      <a href="#details">Details</a>
      <a href="#concierge">Concierge</a>
    </div>
    <a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">Book an appointment</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 0.95fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;width:100%;">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>YOU FOUND THE DUCK</div>
      <h1>Get your ducks<br><em>in a row!</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">You scanned a rubber duck to get here â€” which is either the strangest marketing you've seen this year, or exactly the kind of small, deliberate detail that also goes into every listing, offer, and closing I run.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn-primary" href="#contact">Start the conversation â†’</a>
        <a class="btn-ghost" href="#process">See how it works</a>
      </div>
      <div class="found-note">// duck deployed at open houses, yard signs &amp; mailers around town. this page is what it points to.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="duck-stage">
      <div class="ripple-ring ripple-3"></div>
      <div class="ripple-ring ripple-2"></div>
      <div class="ripple-ring ripple-1"></div>
      <div class="duck-svg-wrap">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Rubber duck" style="width:260px;height:auto;display:block;">
      </div>
      <div class="qr-patch" aria-hidden="true">
        <i></i><i class="off"></i><i></i><i></i><i class="off"></i>
        <i class="off"></i><i></i><i class="off"></i><i></i><i></i>
        <i></i><i class="off"></i><i></i><i class="off"></i><i></i>
        <i class="off"></i><i></i><i class="off"></i><i></i><i class="off"></i>
        <i></i><i></i><i class="off"></i><i></i><i></i>
      </div>
      <div class="qr-tag">SCAN ME</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="agent-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="agent-card reveal">
      <div class="agent-photo-wrap">
        <div class="agent-photo-ring"></div>
        <img class="agent-photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Portrait of Stacy">
        <div class="agent-badge" title="Local agent">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2l7 4v6c0 5-3.5 8-7 10-3.5-2-7-5-7-10V6l7-4z" stroke="#122036" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="agent-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">MEET YOUR AGENT</div>
        <h3>Stacy Barnes</h3>
        <div class="agent-title">REALTORÂ® Â· PSA Â· e-PRO Â· ADVANTAGE REALTY GROUP</div>
        <p class="agent-bio">I grew up going to open houses for fun, which either makes me the perfect person to sell you a home or deeply strange â€” possibly both. These days it means I know which streets flood, which schools are zoned where, and which repair companies actually pick up the phone. That's the job. The duck was just a fun way to say hello.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<svg class="wave-divider" viewBox="0 0 1440 90" preserveAspectRatio="none">
  <path d="M0,32 C240,72 480,0 720,28 C960,56 1200,8 1440,40 L1440,90 L0,90 Z" fill="#122036"></path>
</svg>

<section class="local-section" id="why-local">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="local-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">WHY LOCAL KNOWLEDGE WINS</div>
      <h2>Anyone can pull comps. Not everyone knows why the comp on Maple doesn't count.</h2>
      <p>A spreadsheet tells you what sold. It doesn't tell you that the house sold under-list because of the elementary school redistricting, or that the lot two doors down carries a drainage easement nobody mentions until closing. That's the gap between data and knowledge â€” and it's where deals are actually won or lost.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="local-grid">
      <div class="local-card reveal">
        <div class="num">01 / STREET-LEVEL</div>
        <h3>I walk the block before I price it</h3>
        <p>Traffic patterns, noise from the new interchange, which side gets afternoon sun â€” the things that move a buyer's offer up or down $10â€“20k and never show up in an MLS sheet.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="local-card reveal">
        <div class="num">02 / CIVIC &amp; ZONING</div>
        <h3>I track what's coming, not just what's here</h3>
        <p>Pending rezonings, permit filings, school boundary reviews. I read the planning commission agenda so you don't buy today what changes value tomorrow.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="local-card reveal">
        <div class="num">03 / RELATIONSHIPS</div>
        <h3>I know the inspectors, the other agents, the lenders</h3>
        <p>Local relationships mean your inspection gets scheduled this week, not next month, and the other side's agent picks up my call â€” which keeps your deal moving.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="process-section" id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="process-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">HOW IT ACTUALLY WORKS</div>
      <h2>Ducks in a row, literally</h2>
      <p>Five steps, always in this order. Skipping one is exactly how deals get messy â€” so none get skipped, on any file, for any client.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="pond-track">
      <svg class="pond-path-svg" viewBox="0 0 1180 220" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="none">
        <path d="M40,170 C160,60 260,220 400,120 C520,40 620,200 760,110 C880,40 980,190 1140,90" stroke="#2A6F77" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="1 12" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
      </svg>
      <div class="duck-row">
        <div class="duck-step reveal">
          <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Rubber duck" class="duck-step-icon">
          <div class="step-tag">STEP 1</div>
          <h3>Scout</h3>
          <p>Walk the block, the street, the school zone â€” before a single number gets written down.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="duck-step reveal">
          <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Rubber duck" class="duck-step-icon">
          <div class="step-tag">STEP 2</div>
          <h3>Story</h3>
          <p>Dig into zoning, permits, comps that actually compare â€” and the ones that quietly don't.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="duck-step reveal">
          <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Rubber duck" class="duck-step-icon">
          <div class="step-tag">STEP 3</div>
          <h3>Strategy</h3>
          <p>A pricing and offer plan built on local read, not a national algorithm's best guess.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="duck-step reveal">
          <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Rubber duck" class="duck-step-icon">
          <div class="step-tag">STEP 4</div>
          <h3>Show</h3>
          <p>Staged, photographed, and marketed like it's the only home for sale in the county.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="duck-step reveal">
          <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Rubber duck" class="duck-step-icon">
          <div class="step-tag">STEP 5</div>
          <h3>Close</h3>
          <p>Every deadline, disclosure, and signature tracked to the day. Nothing slips through.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="details-section" id="details">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="details-grid">
      <div class="details-copy reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow">DETAILS MATTER</div>
        <h2>The deal doesn't fall apart on the big things. It falls apart on the small ones.</h2>
        <p>A missed contingency date. An HOA estoppel nobody ordered in time. A repair addendum with the wrong parcel number. None of these make headlines â€” all of them kill closings. My job is to make sure none of them happen on yours.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li class="reveal">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#2A6F77" stroke-width="2"></circle><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#2A6F77" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
          <div><div class="label">Every contingency date on a shared calendar</div><div class="desc">Inspection, appraisal, financing, HOA â€” tracked and reminded, not remembered.</div></div>
        </li>
        <li class="reveal">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#2A6F77" stroke-width="2"></circle><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#2A6F77" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
          <div><div class="label">Disclosures read line by line, twice</div><div class="desc">Once when they're written, once before they're signed. Nothing gets skimmed.</div></div>
        </li>
        <li class="reveal">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#2A6F77" stroke-width="2"></circle><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#2A6F77" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
          <div><div class="label">Numbers double-checked against title and survey</div><div class="desc">Parcel IDs, legal descriptions, and boundary lines confirmed before anyone signs.</div></div>
        </li>
        <li class="reveal">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#2A6F77" stroke-width="2"></circle><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#2A6F77" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
          <div><div class="label">A weekly status note, whether or not you ask</div><div class="desc">You should never have to wonder where things stand. So you won't.</div></div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="concierge-section" id="concierge">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="concierge-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">THE CONCIERGE APPROACH</div>
      <h2>One client at a time, not a pipeline</h2>
      <p>I cap how many clients I work with at once so that every one of them â€” including you â€” gets the same level of attention the first house I ever sold got. That's not a slogan, it's a scheduling decision.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="concierge-grid">
      <div class="concierge-card reveal in">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3l2.6 5.6L21 9.3l-4.5 4.2L17.6 20 12 16.8 6.4 20l1.1-6.5L3 9.3l6.4-.7L12 3z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
        <h3>Direct access, always</h3>
        <p>My cell, not a call center. You reach me, or whoever's covering me while I'm reachable myself, every time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="concierge-card reveal in">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12h16M4 12l5-5M4 12l5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
        <h3>Vetted local vendors</h3>
        <p>Inspectors, contractors, movers, and lenders I've actually worked with â€” not a generic referral list.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="concierge-card reveal in">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="15" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></rect><path d="M8 3v4M16 3v4M4 10h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
        <h3>Scheduling handled for you</h3>
        <p>Showings, inspections, walkthroughs, closing â€” coordinated so you're not the one chasing anyone down.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="concierge-card reveal in">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 21s-7-4.7-9.5-9.1C.6 8.2 2.3 4.8 5.6 4.1 8 3.6 10 4.7 12 7c2-2.3 4-3.4 6.4-2.9 3.3.7 5 4.1 3.1 7.8C19 16.3 12 21 12 21z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
        <h3>Care after closing</h3>
        <p>Utility switch-overs, moving-day logistics, and a check-in at 30 days â€” because the relationship isn't the check.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="final-cta" id="contact">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="final-grid">
      <div class="reveal in">
        <div class="eyebrow">SCAN. CALL. OR JUST SAY HI.</div>
        <h2>Let's get your ducks in a row too.</h2>
        <p>Whether you're buying, selling, or just found a rubber duck somewhere unexpected â€” start with a real conversation, not a form that goes into a queue.</p>
        <div class="final-actions">
